{
  "lote": "_img-aguaje-complex-3-en-1-20261121-1426",
  "identidad_visual": {
    "color_palette": "Primary: hot fuchsia #E6177F and deep magenta #B0105E. Secondary: bottle black #0E0E10, bubblegum pink #FF8CC0, pale blush pink #FBE3EE, white #FFFFFF, and aguaje orange #D9572B only for fruit accents.",
    "visual_style": "Premium Latin American beauty-supplement ad: glossy pink gradient background, the black-and-fuchsia bottle as hero, real aguaje fruits, a framed photo of a woman from behind in fitted athletic shorts, clean thin-line icon modules and a rounded bottom offer bar.",
    "visual_atmosphere": "Feminine, confident, warm and aspirational; soft daylight, believable and natural.",
    "graphic_language": "Rounded pill banners and bars in deep magenta, thin-line white icons inside white-outlined circles, soft translucent pink petal and heart shapes in the background, handwritten script accents with small hearts, real aguaje fruits with a halved orange-flesh fruit.",
    "text_typography": "Heavy geometric sans-serif (Montserrat ExtraBold / Poppins Black look), all uppercase for headline, icon labels and bottom bar; huge accent word with thick white outline and soft drop shadow; casual handwritten brush script for short emotional accents.",
    "art_direction": "High-contrast pink-and-black look, the product always sharp and identical to the photo, the woman photographed with maximum realism (real skin texture, natural light), natural athletic curves in glutes and thighs, everything clean and readable on a phone."
  },
  "descripcion_visual_en": "A matte black cylindrical plastic supplement bottle, about 1.6 times taller than wide, with a glossy hot-pink/magenta screw cap printed with a repeating small white 'VITALABH' wordmark pattern, and a solid hot-pink band wrapping the bottom fifth of the bottle. The black label shows, from top to bottom: a small pink VITALABH emblem with the white word 'VITALABH'; a huge bold white condensed word 'AGUAJE'; the line 'COMPLEX 3 EN 1' with 'COMPLEX' in white and '3 EN 1' in pink-red; a thin hot-pink banner reading 'SUPLEMENTO ALIMENTICIO EN CÁPSULAS'; a small white line 'A base de Aguaje, Fenogreco y Maca Negra'; a bold italic hot-pink 'TRIPLE ACCIÓN' with a pink swoosh underline; three small black rounded boxes outlined in pink joined by white plus signs reading '200mg AGUAJE', '400mg FENOGRECO' and '200mg MACA NEGRA'; and at the bottom '60 CÁPSULAS | (0.5 g c/u Cont. Neto 30g)' in small white type.",
